{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is to retrieve 50 missing shopping carts and push them all back to their designated parking spots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is no easy job. You'll need plenty of patience, a sharp mind, and nimble hands to become a qualified shopping cart pusher, otherwise, I guarantee you'll never find all the carts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038570/extras/367a617e298b894e8d20bbe5a0610020.poster.avif?t=1765428936\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038570/extras/367a617e298b894e8d20bbe5a0610020.webm?t=1765428936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038570/extras/367a617e298b894e8d20bbe5a0610020.mp4?t=1765428936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on a physics-based simulation, your shopping carts will become uncontrollable due to impacts and inertia.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the entire shopping mall, finding the missing carts in the parking lot, shops, supermarket, and even on the rooftop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use surrounding objects to discover hidden information in the environment to solve puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the shopping carts to earn money to unlock items and power-ups.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038570/extras/643fc312213eacb05e4556c7935364d2.poster.avif?t=1765428936\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038570/extras/643fc312213eacb05e4556c7935364d2.webm?t=1765428936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038570/extras/643fc312213eacb05e4556c7935364d2.mp4?t=1765428936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prank your customers by knocking them down, stuffing them into your cart, and launching them away.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend the shopping mall by grabbing nearby items and knocking down any mischievous customers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect various secrets hidden throughout the mall to uncover different hidden endings.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038570/extras/4f60978123a01b3d88ddf26e0103e7a1.poster.avif?t=1765428936\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038570/extras/4f60978123a01b3d88ddf26e0103e7a1.webm?t=1765428936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038570/extras/4f60978123a01b3d88ddf26e0103e7a1.mp4?t=1765428936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Cart","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4038570/c5a3634d714a482a27a24805860194e785236d1e.jpg"},{"name":"A Train","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4038570/7dcb99f74882aac202f358d8df866f00ed827b8e.jpg"},{"name":"All back in place","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4038570/c96382ce4823a7153f576838ed3199f53d21e180.jpg"},{"name":"Poster collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4038570/29ef18c56bdf9abffe5de4c74de570369b8de839.jpg"},{"name":"Rubber ducks","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4038570/e49fcb4b7a9f74e132e98c71eb8628deb77c20c3.jpg"},{"name":"Finding cat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4038570/b33f4e2f6b99d16bb2555be5c670a5ec251ee64a.jpg"},{"name":"Go home","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4038570/0e2d73117587957de47e5e420efdd78c2c89db11.jpg"},{"name":"Shopping cart plan","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4038570/2953a4f12b589d6e138fc83cfea57b38f8ac6a93.jpg"},{"name":"Naughty cat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4038570/5a628b59297ccb98915e6a755f1c4056e8749c07.jpg"}],"total":9},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4038570?t=1765428936","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4038570?t=1765428936","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038570/8ac00c32898cba653fa88129e4d8b8caacc6dfb4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765428936","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038570/8ac00c32898cba653fa88129e4d8b8caacc6dfb4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765428936","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4113660,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is to retrieve 50 missing shopping carts and push them all back to their designated parking spots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is no easy job. You'll need plenty of patience, a sharp mind, and nimble hands to become a qualified shopping cart pusher, otherwis